{
  "name": "Defect List -> Google Drive Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup checklist\nFolder terpisah, khusus defect list (bukan di dalam folder proyek yang lama): `Defect List (root)` → `<Kode Nama Proyek>` → `<Tanggal YYYY-MM-DD>` → foto/video. Semuanya (folder proyek & folder tanggal) dibuat OTOMATIS kalau belum ada — tidak perlu setup manual per proyek.\n\nDipakai utk 2 hal (sama webhook, dibedakan field `jenis` dari app): temuan awal (Supervisor) DAN bukti pengerjaan (Mandor) — file bukti dikasih label \"Bukti - \" di nama filenya, tetap masuk folder tanggal yang sama.\n\nSetelah upload sukses, workflow ini juga lapor balik ke app (endpoint /api/drive-sync/confirm, ikut kirim `jenis` supaya app update kolom retensi yang benar) supaya app tahu file ini aman dihapus dari Supabase Storage nanti (lihat n8n/defect-list-cleanup-schedule.json — workflow terpisah utk itu).\n\n1. Di Google Drive, buat 1 folder baru bernama \"Defect List\" (di mana saja, boleh di My Drive Anda) — ini jadi root-nya.\n2. Buka node **Normalize**, isi 3 hal: `rootFolderId` (ID folder di atas, dari URL drive.google.com/drive/folders/<ID_INI>), `appBaseUrl` (URL app Anda, TANPA garis miring di akhir, mis. https://aplikasi-mandor.vercel.app), dan `callbackSecret` (nilai `N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET` dari .env.local app — sama persis).\n3. Di semua node **HTTP Request** (yang manggil googleapis.com) → tab Credentials → pilih credential Google Drive OAuth2 Anda (yang sudah dipakai di workflow n8n lain).\n4. Di node **Upload Foto** dan **Upload Video** → pilih credential Google Drive yang sama.\n5. Klik **Activate**, lalu copy Production URL dari node **Webhook** → paste ke `.env.local` project (`N8N_DRIVE_WEBHOOK_URL=...`).\n6. Test: buat defect baru dari app (Supervisor → Defect List) dengan foto/video → cek folder `<Nama Proyek>/<Tanggal>` otomatis kebuat di dalam folder \"Defect List\" itu, dan cek kolom `drive_synced_at` di tabel `checklist_perbaikan` sudah terisi.\n\nKalau ada node bertanda seru merah setelah import, biasanya cuma soal pilih ulang credential/field dari dropdown (versi n8n beda sedikit bisa beda label field).",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Setup Checklist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ -400, -300 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "defect-drive-sync",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ -400, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    proyek: body.proyek,\n    proyekId: body.proyekId,\n    tanggal: body.tanggal,\n    items: body.items || [],\n    // GANTI ketiga nilai di bawah ini:\n    // ID folder Google Drive \"Defect List\" (root khusus fitur ini) — dari\n    // URL folder: drive.google.com/drive/folders/<ID_INI>\n    rootFolderId: \"ISI_DENGAN_ID_FOLDER_ROOT_DRIVE_ANDA\",\n    // URL app Anda, TANPA garis miring di akhir\n    appBaseUrl: \"https://taracoapp.com\",\n    // Harus SAMA PERSIS dengan N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET di .env.local app\n    callbackSecret: \"05f224ab1d0f179c0e4ba76f51c677ac82095e6d1550d73a\",\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "normalize",
      "name": "Normalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ -160, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "q", "value": "=name='{{ $json.proyek.replace(/'/g, \"\\\\'\") }}' and mimeType='application/vnd.google-apps.folder' and '{{ $json.rootFolderId }}' in parents and trashed=false" },
            { "name": "fields", "value": "files(id,name)" },
            { "name": "supportsAllDrives", "value": "true" },
            { "name": "includeItemsFromAllDrives", "value": "true" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "search-proyek",
      "name": "Cari Folder Proyek",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [ 80, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "cond-proyek", "leftValue": "={{ $json.files.length }}", "rightValue": 0, "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-proyek",
      "name": "Proyek Ada?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [ 320, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const norm = $('Normalize').first().json;\nconst found = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...norm, projectFolderId: found.files[0].id } }];"
      },
      "id": "set-proyek-existing",
      "name": "ProjectFolder - Existing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 560, -80 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [ { "name": "supportsAllDrives", "value": "true" } ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"name\": $('Normalize').first().json.proyek, \"mimeType\": \"application/vnd.google-apps.folder\", \"parents\": [ $('Normalize').first().json.rootFolderId ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "create-proyek",
      "name": "Buat Folder Proyek",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [ 560, 160 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const norm = $('Normalize').first().json;\nconst created = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...norm, projectFolderId: created.id } }];"
      },
      "id": "set-proyek-created",
      "name": "ProjectFolder - Created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 800, 160 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: $input.first().json }];"
      },
      "id": "folder-proyek-siap",
      "name": "Folder Proyek Siap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 1040, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "q", "value": "=name='{{ $json.tanggal }}' and mimeType='application/vnd.google-apps.folder' and '{{ $json.projectFolderId }}' in parents and trashed=false" },
            { "name": "fields", "value": "files(id,name)" },
            { "name": "supportsAllDrives", "value": "true" },
            { "name": "includeItemsFromAllDrives", "value": "true" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "search-tanggal",
      "name": "Cari Folder Tanggal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [ 1280, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "cond-tanggal", "leftValue": "={{ $json.files.length }}", "rightValue": 0, "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-tanggal",
      "name": "Tanggal Ada?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [ 1520, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const base = $('Folder Proyek Siap').first().json;\nconst found = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, dateFolderId: found.files[0].id } }];"
      },
      "id": "set-tanggal-existing",
      "name": "DateFolder - Existing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 1760, -80 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [ { "name": "supportsAllDrives", "value": "true" } ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"name\": $('Folder Proyek Siap').first().json.tanggal, \"mimeType\": \"application/vnd.google-apps.folder\", \"parents\": [ $('Folder Proyek Siap').first().json.projectFolderId ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "create-tanggal",
      "name": "Buat Folder Tanggal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [ 1760, 160 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const base = $('Folder Proyek Siap').first().json;\nconst created = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, dateFolderId: created.id } }];"
      },
      "id": "set-tanggal-created",
      "name": "DateFolder - Created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 2000, 160 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: $input.first().json }];"
      },
      "id": "folder-siap",
      "name": "Folder Siap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 2240, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const base = $input.first().json;\nconst safe = (s) => String(s || '').replace(/[\\\\/:*?\"<>|]/g, '-').slice(0, 60).trim();\nreturn (base.items || []).map((it) => {\n  const label = it.jenis === 'bukti' ? 'Bukti - ' : '';\n  return {\n    json: {\n      id: it.id,\n      no: it.no,\n      uraian: it.uraian,\n      jenis: it.jenis === 'bukti' ? 'bukti' : 'temuan',\n      fotoUrl: it.fotoUrl,\n      fotoExt: it.fotoExt,\n      videoUrl: it.videoUrl,\n      videoExt: it.videoExt,\n      dateFolderId: base.dateFolderId,\n      fotoFileName: it.fotoUrl ? `${it.no} - ${label}${safe(it.uraian)}.${it.fotoExt || 'jpg'}` : null,\n      videoFileName: it.videoUrl ? `${it.no} - ${label}${safe(it.uraian)}.${it.videoExt || 'mp4'}` : null,\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "pecah-item",
      "name": "Pecah Item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 2480, 40 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "cond-foto", "leftValue": "={{ $json.fotoUrl }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-foto",
      "name": "Ada Foto?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [ 2720, -100 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.fotoUrl }}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file" } } }
      },
      "id": "download-foto",
      "name": "Download Foto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [ 2960, -160 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
